            </note>
            <note corresp="#d279-f3" n="3" xml:id="d279-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed; for a summary of the contents, see telegram 99, from Moscow,
                    received at 2:26 p. m. on July 11, <ref target="#pg360">p. 360</ref>, and also
                    British Cmd. 8078, p. 28.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
